<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en-us"><generator uri="https://gohugo.io/" version="0.161.1">Hugo</generator><title type="html">徐徐微风</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/bfs/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="html"/><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/bfs/index.xml" rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="rss"/><updated>2026-08-07T17:02:52+00:00</updated><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/tags/bfs/</id><entry><title type="html">LeetCode 0743. 网络延迟时间</title><link href="https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/leetcode/leetcode-0743-network-delay-time/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/><id>https://1024daniel.github.io/posts/leetcode/leetcode-0743-network-delay-time/</id><author><name>Daniel Diana</name></author><published>2026-06-15T01:15:03+08:00</published><updated>2026-06-15T01:15:03+08:00</updated><content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>原题链接：</strong><a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/network-delay-time/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LeetCode 0743. 网络延迟时间</a></p>
